>**{c=red:You may have to change zones after completing }{q:Sin Hunting|Sin Hunting|Sin Hunting}{c=red: to start this quest!}**
=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Perih Vashai} in {z:Windurst Woods} (K-7) and she will tell you to go to {z:Mhaura} and visit the Blacksmiths' guild.
* In {z:Mhaura} head to (F-9) to speak with {n:Koh Lenbalalako}. Speak with her twice to receive a cutscene where she will tell you to head to {z:Eldieme Necropolis}.
** Koh is found inside the Blacksmith Guild.
* Enter {z:Eldieme Necropolis} through {z:Batallia Downs} at (I-10) and get another cutscene with the Mithran Tracker telling you to examine the stone monuments in search of the name of the sinner's daughter.
** You do not need to be on ranger for this part of the quest.
** The {z:Eldieme Necropolis} {p:Survival Guide} will put you at the correct entrance, but will not activate the cutscene. You must zone out and back in.
* Head to (G-9) and examine the Gravestone to trigger another cutscene with the Mithra Tracker.
** If you have the {k:Magicked astrolabe} you can get here solo.
* After the cutscene head back to {z:Windurst Woods} and speak with {p:Perih Vashai} again.
* You will get another cutscene with the Mithran Tracker, where you are told by {p:Perih Vashai} to head to {z:Castle Oztroja} to search a pool for an {i:Old Earring|Old Earring|1113}.
* **The next step in {z:Castle Oztroja} requires {p:Scavenge}, so set your job or subjob accordingly.**
** Once in {z:Castle Oztroja} head to (I-8) on the first map, and hit the correct handle to go through the brass door.
** On the second map, head to (I-10) to get the 4 switch password for the game day. Then head to the brass door at (G-8) and enter the 4 switch combination.
*** You can also just play around with it until it opens rather than go to the room at (I-10).
** Head up the stairs to the third map where you'll find a pool of water with leeches in it at (H-9).
** Use the job ability {p:Scavenge} until you get the {i:Old Earring|Old Earring|1113}.
*** This may take more than one attempt. You can come as a high level job and sub Ranger for {p:Scavenge}, as you can obtain the earring this way.
* Take the {i:Old Earring|Old Earring|1113} and trade it to {p:Perih Vashai} for a cutscene and the {i:Hunter's Beret|Hunter's Beret|12518}.

